.TH dg 1 "donguru" "" "Donguru"
.SH NAME
dg \- short alias for donguru, the Donguru USB\-C dongle CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdg\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBdg\fR is a symlink to \fBdonguru\fR installed by this package: every command, flag and
subcommand is identical.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBdonguru\fR(1) and its subcommand pages (\fBdonguru\-device\fR(1), \fBdonguru\-power\fR(1), ...)
for the full command tree.
